==Battleground==
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gude-Doge Machine]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

